# Old URLs that have been passed around by hand and must keep working.
#
# Every rule is listed twice, bare and with a trailing slash, because Pages
# matches the path literally. Only the bare form was here at first, so
# /guest-summary redirected and /guest-summary/ fell through to the SPA shell,
# where the client-side HashRedirect was the only thing putting it right. That
# held until a copy of the old page was cached at the slash form: the shell
# never loaded, the client-side redirect never ran, and the link served a
# months-old page for as long as the cache held it.
#
# Targets carry the trailing slash the prerendered pages actually live at.
# Without it the browser follows this 301 into Pages' own 308 to the canonical
# form — two hops where one will do.
#
# The browser reattaches the #fragment across a 301 on its own, so deep links
# like /travel-tips#what-to-pack still survive.
/travel-tips   /travel/tips/   301
/travel-tips/  /travel/tips/   301

# The admin tools moved to Wedding HQ, behind Cloudflare Access, when the
# passphrase-encrypted roster they read was taken out of the public schedule
# index. /admin itself stays on this site as a page of links; the tools' old
# URLs, and the even older top-level ones that used to 301 to them, all go
# straight to HQ.
#
# 302, not 301, unlike the rule above. A browser keeps a 301 for as long as it
# likes, so if this move were ever rolled back, every admin's browser would go
# on sending them to HQ regardless. These are the family's bookmarks, not links
# out in the world, so nothing is lost by asking again each time.
#
# HQ's pages have no trailing slash; it is a client-side app, not prerendered.
#
# None of these paths may be prerendered again — a matching static file would
# shadow these rules. scripts/prerender.js and prerenderRoutes.test.tsx both hold
# that line, and the test also holds the two-forms-per-rule shape.
/admin/invite-links    https://hq.anupamaandjackson.com/invite-links   302
/admin/invite-links/   https://hq.anupamaandjackson.com/invite-links   302
/admin/guest-summary   https://hq.anupamaandjackson.com/guests         302
/admin/guest-summary/  https://hq.anupamaandjackson.com/guests         302
